FURTHER READING

If you want to reproduce any of the measurements in this repository on your own
hardware, that is encouraged and is the point of the dataset. What you cannot do
is redistribute the vendor documents behind the citations.

The sigrok `.sr` capture container format is used here as a data interchange
format. Any sigrok or libsigrok software you use to read it is licensed
separately by its own authors under its own terms; no sigrok code is included
in this repository.
